# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NAVI Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit .env.local to git.

# ── Client (Vite) — safe to expose in the browser ─────
# Supabase — get these from your Supabase project dashboard:
# https://app.supabase.com → Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# ── Local Vite /api proxy (REQUIRED for chat in `pnpm dev`) ──
# Server-side only — never prefix with VITE_. Vite configureServer
# loads these via loadEnv and mounts /api/chat + /api/generate-avatar.
#
# REQUIRED for local chat: copy this file to .env.local (or append the line)
# and paste your key from https://openrouter.ai/keys
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# Without it, POST /api/chat returns 500 in `pnpm dev`.
# Never commit .env.local. Never prefix this key with VITE_.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional — Black Forest Labs FLUX Pro portraits (falls back if unset)
# BFL_API_KEY=

# ── Production NAVI Cloud (Vercel) — managed metering ─
# These power api/chat.ts + api/usage.ts Edge functions.
# Set in Vercel project settings (Production + Preview).
# See MONETIZATION.md for the full setup + tuning guide.
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...          # same key as above (shared credit pool)
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...       # falls back to VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...  # Settings → API → service_role (KEEP SECRET)
